  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Allllllright, well, we got to get you to that game.
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: Grandma and I will be waiting to give you a hug afterwards.
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: "I know you wish Mom could be here but please don\u2019t take it out
      on your grandma."
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: "The last thing she needs is you being defensive. She\u2019s so proud
      of you."
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
